    <description>&quot;Uncovered&quot; accounts in the US at the Fortune 1k rank. 
Note: Some accounts&apos; parent companies may be covered and some accounts are Education, Government, and/or public sector; for those we don&apos;t currently cover. It is good practice to always check.</description>
